name: Touch Cursor
icon: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/touch-cursor/icon.svg
version: 1.0.0
creator: Mohtadi Azad Mahi
description: Adds a virtual desktop cursor for touch screens, driven by an on-screen pad — click, right-click, hold, and hover anything, with a full Modifications panel for cursor style, size, sensitivity, pad size/opacity, pad mode, and pad shortcuts.
